{"id":"1391f74d0e8dd998","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-degree-structure-theorem.md","title":"Degree Structure Theorem","display":"thm-degree-structure-theorem — Degree Structure Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-degree-structure-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-degree-structure-theorem"],"display":"thm-degree-structure-theorem — Degree Structure Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-turing-degree]]","[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]","[[68-df-degree-join]]","[[68-df-degree-jump]]","[[68-thm-jump-theorem]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§15 pp.53-54,58-59 / PDF 62-63,67-68","verification_status":"source-adapted-statement","source_proof_status":"argument-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-degree-structure-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-degree-structure-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-degree-structure-theorem — Degree Structure Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"43fcc2f44ce938e0\" href=\"?note=43fcc2f44ce938e0\" title=\"68-df-turing-degree\">68-df-turing-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ed6f28789f0aa57\" href=\"?note=4ed6f28789f0aa57\" title=\"68-df-degree-join\">68-df-degree-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ad7581c464c34d3\" href=\"?note=4ad7581c464c34d3\" title=\"68-df-degree-jump\">68-df-degree-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"87e145f3544aae62\" href=\"?note=87e145f3544aae62\" title=\"68-thm-jump-theorem\">68-thm-jump-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§15 pp.53-54,58-59 / PDF 62-63,67-68"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-statement"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"argument-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0\">\\(\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"43fcc2f44ce938e0\" href=\"?note=43fcc2f44ce938e0\" title=\"68-df-turing-degree\">68-df-turing-degree</a>，度序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a>，度 join 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ed6f28789f0aa57\" href=\"?note=4ed6f28789f0aa57\" title=\"68-df-degree-join\">68-df-degree-join</a>，度跳跃见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ad7581c464c34d3\" href=\"?note=4ad7581c464c34d3\" title=\"68-df-degree-jump\">68-df-degree-jump</a>。跳跃性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"87e145f3544aae62\" href=\"?note=87e145f3544aae62\" title=\"68-thm-jump-theorem\">68-thm-jump-theorem</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\;(\\mathbf0\\le\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf a&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\;(\\mathbf0\\le\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf a&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b\\land\\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\;((\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf c\\land\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf c)\\Longrightarrow\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf c)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b\\land\\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\;((\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf c\\land\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf c)\\Longrightarrow\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf c)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 §15 的最小度、15.1 最小上界及 p.59 跳跃。任一 oracle 都可忽略自身计算递归集，故零度最小；join 的两个分量可解码，任何同时计算两者的 oracle 可按奇偶性计算 join。删除旧全度稠密断言：若存在极小非零度，它已直接反驳该断言。极小度存在与连续统基数等原书未覆盖的扩展不再混入这项来源核验结果，极小度另见保留的 pending 条目。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-degree-join","status":"resolved","id":"4ed6f28789f0aa57","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-degree-jump","status":"resolved","id":"4ad7581c464c34d3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-jump-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"87e145f3544aae62","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-jump-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]，度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]。跳跃性质见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]，度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]。跳跃性质见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-degree-join","status":"resolved","id":"4ed6f28789f0aa57","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]，度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]。跳跃性质见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-degree-jump","status":"resolved","id":"4ad7581c464c34d3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]，度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]。跳跃性质见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-jump-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"87e145f3544aae62","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]，度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]。跳跃性质见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\;(\\mathbf0\\le\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf a<\\mathbf a').","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b\\land\\forall\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\;((\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf c\\land\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf c)\\Longrightarrow\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf c)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1754,"backlinks":[{"id":"4ed6f28789f0aa57","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"若 A≡_T Ã、B≡_T B̃，按查询的奇偶性分别调用相应归约，即得 A⊕B≡_T Ã⊕B̃。因此右侧集合族只有一个元素，取并给出唯一的度。它的最小上界性质由 [[68-thm-degree-structure-theorem]] 明确陈述。"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-degree-structure-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-degree-structure-theorem|thm-degree-structure-theorem — Degree Structure Theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["43fcc2f44ce938e0","52c2209f400df1a9","4ed6f28789f0aa57","4ad7581c464c34d3","87e145f3544aae62"]}